    <string name="help_body">1. The bottom buttons open Help, Application skin, and About Us.\n\n2. Add Audio lets you choose the MP3 soundtrack.\n\n3. Add Video/Image lets you choose one picture, multiple pictures, or one short video.\n\n4. Merge To Video opens export settings, including image time, and starts saving the final MP4.\n\n5. The status panel shows the selected visual, selected audio, and current export setup.\n\n6. Preview shows how the visual will look and lets you play the audio preview.</string>
